      {
        "id": "worst-case-lower-bound",
        "moduleId": "lower-bound-proof",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "最坏情况下界：n log n 的量级",
        "markdown": "引理 8.3：对给定的 $n$，任何通过比较对 $n$ 个元素排序的算法，其决策树（$B$-树）的深度至少为 $\\lceil\\log(n!)\\rceil$，因为 $n!$ 片树叶要求 $n!\\le 2^d$。\n\n定理 8.4 由此给出最坏情况下的下界：任何比较排序算法在最坏情况下的时间复杂度不低于 $\\lceil\\log(n!)\\rceil$，近似为 $n\\log n-1.5n$。其估计来自\n\n$$\\log(n!)=\\sum_{j=1}^{n}\\log j\\ge\\int_{1}^{n}\\log x\\,dx=n\\log n-n\\log e+\\log e\\approx n\\log n-1.5n.$$\n\n因此最坏情况下时间复杂度为 $O(n\\log n)$ 的归并排序和堆排序，其阶已经最优：比较排序算法类中不存在最坏情况突破 $n\\log n$ 阶的算法。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-1806e31d4fe9355410d41c62",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000125"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "第 5 章",
                "排序算法的决策树与算法类时间复杂度的下界"
              ],
              "lineStart": 8342,
              "lineEnd": 8438,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0003/images/41e7f567dfb15557271c150f2c719452c742a78b4b46dcfebc52dc9906a2145e.jpg",
                "parts/part-0003/images/eaa93311b248f9f5a2d3e04683ea42d1161df6a5ae4edd3503bbbd8cc14cdd0d.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "8ffbe779398136b6fac32a30feda47c9090d02906f016ef07e9fca5d1a70c93f"
            }
          ]
        }
